},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\nv4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\nv4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the replace (ctrl + r) input box is focused, `enter` has to be pressed twice to replace the next occurrence.\n\nA possible cause:\nThe blinking cursor disappears from the replace input box on the first `enter` press, and it returns on the second.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the project: issue-replace-text-requires-enter-twice.zip\n- in the file system panel, double click: new_script.gd\n- in the script editor, left click on the first line to place the cursor there\n- press: `ctrl + f`\n- type: `abc`\n- press: `ctrl + r`\n- type: `x`\n- note the blinking cursor in the replace input box\n- press: `enter`\n- as expected, the first occurrence of 'abc' was replaced with 'x'\n- but, now the blinking cursor has disappeared from the replace input box. The replace input box seems to still be focused because it has a blue border.\n- press: `enter`\n- nothing was replaced, but now the blinking cursor has returned to the replace input box\n- press: `enter`\n- now the second occurrence of 'abc' was replaced, but again the blinking cursor disappeared\n- press: `enter`\n- the blinking cursor returned\n- press: `enter`\n- now the third occurrence of 'abc' was replaced, but again the blinking cursor disappeared\n- Issue, enter has to be pressed twice to replace the next occurrence.\n\nExpected: pressing `enter` once should replace the next occurrence\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[issue-replace-text-requires-enter-twice.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25693257/issue-replace-text-requires-enter-twice.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116975/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}